<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-14T17:24:47.028Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:24:47 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits continue to carry out lethal attacks in Zamfara, killing soldiers and civilians, while gunmen killed dozens in separate assaults. ISWAP militants assaulted a military base in Adamawa and were repelled, and a Nigerian air strike in Borno eliminated over 40 ISWAP fighters and a top Lakurawa militant. The Senate has begun probing NAF aircraft maintenance after a crash killed 25 in Ondo. Atiku Abubakar urged security agencies to rescue an abducted family in Kaduna. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261014-dangote-refinery-extends-ipo-plant-has-reshaped-nigeria-s-fuel-market&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1HU3RuWFppRXNtbmRBUjFfSTEtOHZuemp2Z2V3aGdvY1A2U2pKMk8xOERPWGdWNWFuRk45Z2xUcUI5eGxBc2FsMDZTbFQtZldTTmdlNGp6MnhfemhVRHFlNktPclNNcVNGbDVlZjM0aTd2NlZZSzRsT2VRRy1Kdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQczFfSFRPOG5EYXJNQTVMa0p2T0JRMXRXS0Npak1lS0x3RkRXVW1IS0xxZGpQQm9Fb1o4WlZwTWYxZmcyTUpOZnRRN05UWlBlMjY1elM0RHYzcUR4WkRuSFJtSkxVZkxBTmt4cDZoYlNtaGlPR1lZQTRTN1dWMTN3TElYenBPT0Jac3M5MVdZa0tPNlVrZ0t6NVUtZEpNQm_SAaYBQVVfeXFMTThsc2tsczlCTG1VX2ZpbW4yNXFMVFktU21lRUNsaDlNWHhOVGZTRVdJOS1faml2M2tkbS1tcnlsVUM4c2xLMDdsbVYyWVFiUWRyUG5PZGhESEtHbGFKaUl2UEV4QmdDd0NwRGsweGFzZWZCRElnNnh3OEs0bzN5bU45a2JFWmJSZHVUWDdjZVM5ZW12SDNFVzNaMWtwclp2bUN3WXl0UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNbXExNDNWZkdZTElwdThsRXRZNnQ3c0M4TVlrZUhKWVdSZXhsS2xkS0hZbnRkbmFPUmVQMVhwM1I5QmVTQzlpOEc4eU5lbW05a3Atb25ZMnJuMTJzWGZoWFF6YlFYdTRXWG12MTUtTkxreGQ0TEFwRzZWVV84QUxKaTlZRUlPbGZmZmdVN2RNc1NOOVltQ2hIRVJyOVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&